{{#> layout
  title='How to use AI to advance your language learning'
  metaDescription='Ask ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude your everyday questions in the language you are learning, and get replies plus grammar corrections. Ready-made prompt inside.'
  url='/ai.html'
  ogDescription='Bring your everyday questions to AI in the language you are learning. A ready-made prompt to get you started.'
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
  disabledAutoTrack=true
}}
  <style>
    :root {
      --info-radius: 0.75rem;
      --info-padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .select-language {
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background-position: right var(--info-padding) center;
    }

    .info-panel {
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
    }

    .info-panel[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .call-out {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
      border-left: 4px solid #0050ff;
      max-width: 600px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .source-note {
      font-size: 80%;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .setup-section {
      background: #f9f9f9;
    }

    .setup-section > .container-md {
      font-size: 80%;
    }

    .setup-section h2 {
      color: var(--bs-body-color);
      font-size: 140%;
    }

    #prompt-wrapper {
      font-size: 90%;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;

      #prompt {
        display: block;
      }

      #copy-button {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: var(--info-padding);
        right: var(--info-padding);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        font-size: 90%;
      }
    }

    #ai-tabs {
      .ai-tabs-nav {
        gap: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: #ececec;
        border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      }

      .ai-tab {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bs-secondary-color);
        border-radius: calc(var(--info-radius) - 0.25rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          background-color 0.15s ease,
          color 0.15s ease,
          box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }

      .ai-tab:hover {
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
      }

      .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      }

      .ai-tab .bi {
        font-size: 1.15em;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .ai-instruction {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .bi-box-arrow-up-right {
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin-left: 0.35em;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="pt-3 pb-5">
      <h1 class="h3">How to effectively use AI to advance your language learning</h1>

      <p class="source-note" data-nosnippet>This page is based on a discovery I made and shared with the <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/learndutch/s/vlO10JmnUl" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">r/learndutch community on Reddit<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-2"></i></a>.</p>

      <p>You probably already ask AI about work, recipes, and travel plans.</p>

      <p>Ask those same questions in the language you're learning, and the global prompt below makes the AI reply in that language, evaluate your grammar and style, and suggest improvements.</p>

      <blockquote class="call-out">
        Solve your daily problems in the language you're learning &mdash; this is the fastest way to language mastery.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="setup-section">
    <div class="container-md py-5">
      <h2 class="h5">How to set it up</h2>

      <p>Works with ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude. Takes two minutes.</p>

      <div class="mb-5">
        <p>Which language are you learning?</p>

        <select id="language" name="language" aria-label="Language" class="select-language form-select form-select-sm mb-4">
          {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
            <option value="{{this.code}}">{{this.label}}</option>
          {{/each}}
        </select>

        <p>Copy this global prompt:</p>

        <pre class="info-panel" id="prompt-wrapper"><code id="prompt"></code><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy"></i><span>Copy</span></button></pre>

        <p>Add the copied prompt to your AI assistant's context:</p>

        <div id="ai-tabs" class="mb-4">
          <div class="ai-tabs-nav d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
              data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
              aria-selected="true"
            ><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i>ChatGPT</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-gemini"
              data-ai-tab="gemini"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Gemini</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-claude"
              data-ai-tab="claude"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i>Claude</button>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
            data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Custom instructions</strong> section of <a
                href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >ChatGPT Personalization<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-gemini"
            data-ai-panel="gemini"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Open <a
                href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Gemini personal context<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>, tick the <strong>Your instructions for
                Gemini</strong> checkbox, then click <strong>+ Add</strong> and paste the prompt.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-claude"
            data-ai-panel="claude"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Instructions for Claude</strong> section of your <a
                href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Claude profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Now the hard part: bring your real questions to the AI in <span data-language-string>your target language</span>. At first, you'll look up a lot of words just to ask a question and read the answer. That difficulty is exactly what builds fluency.</p>

        <p class="show-chrome">The <a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/vocably/baocigmmhhdemijfjnjdidbkfgpgogmb">Vocably Chrome Extension</a> will help you a great deal in formulating your questions, translating AI responses, and learning the words you discover along the way.</p>
      </div>
      {{> social-share
        page="ai.html"
      }}
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}
